abstract: >-
  Servify is a service management platform developed to
  support the digital transformation of small businesses.
  The application provides tools for managing services,
  customer relationships, employee activities, and
  scheduling processes within a unified environment. Its
  goal is to simplify business operations, improve
  organizational efficiency, and enhance the overall
  experience for both service providers and customers.
